<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Glowing Fungus</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 5), Ranger (guild level 45, up to 50%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast glowing fungus</a>
</pre>
<p>The caster holds out one hand and a glowing chunk of fungus sprouts on the 
ground, shimmering like the moon on a winter's eve. It lights up the dark 
around it, which is handy in caves, or for finding the outhouse at night 
without skinning your shins.
</p><p>It can be picked up and held. Left on the ground, it dissolves into slime 
within about five minutes; carried, it lasts until you put it down. You 
must be standing. It is also found on wands, staffs and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Magic Candle</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spell Light</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>